OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused copied TV killer
OL,4,ADexter, jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA forensics student obsessed with the
OL,7,FUS TV drama Dexter set up a copycat
OL,8,F"kill room" in an Airbnb to stab a
OL,9,Fwoman to death, a jury has heard.
OL,11,FBenjamin William Day, 20, a University
OL,12,Fof Worcester undergraduate, was
OL,13,Farrested wearing a khaki top resembling
OL,14,Fone worn by Dexter after inflicting 78
OL,15,Fknife wounds on Maria Saceanu,
OL,16,FWolverhampton Crown Court was told.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
