OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused copied TV killer
OL,4,ADexter, jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the case against Day,
OL,7,Fprosecutor Rachel Brand KC said he had
OL,8,F"lured" Saceanu, a sex worker, to the
OL,9,Froom where he had amassed a number of
OL,10,Fitems used to kill her and dispose of
OL,11,Fevidence.
OL,13,FDay, of Redditch, Worcestershire, who
OL,14,Fdenies murder, was arrested after
OL,15,Finjuring his hand and calling 999 for
OL,16,Fhelp in December, the court heard.
